*.kicad_prl
**/*-backups/
**/#auto_saved_files#
**/_autosave-*
**/*.lck
**/fp-info-cache
**/*.bak
**/__pycache__/
*.code-workspace

# Local upstream source checkouts used to derive curated V2 KiCad assets.
# Revisions and licences are recorded in the V2 target-library provenance.
KICAD/V2/upstream/

# Local V2 parts research, purchasing records and draft reference material.
docs/design/V2Harness/Parts/

# Local firmware archives are kept for bench use but not committed remotely.
firmware/*/
firmware/*/*/
!firmware/README.md

# Ignore draw.io backup files
**/*.drawio.bkp
docs/design/V2Harness/arch/diagrams/Archive/

# Local, regenerated Rev-A verification exports. Reviewed, normalized evidence
# under verification/baseline remains tracked.
KICAD/V2/RevA/Espruino_Harness_RevA/verification/generated/
KICAD/V2/RevA/Espruino_Harness_RevA/*.net
KICAD/V2/RevA/Espruino_Harness_RevA/*ERC.rpt

# Local implementation notes and editor recovery files. Accepted conclusions
# belong in the implementation baseline and source drawings.
docs/design/V2Harness/implementation/TempNotes.md
**/.$*.drawio.dtmp

# ignore BOM experiments
KICAD/V2/MinimalBom/
